crc-rust: Rust mirror of Nicoretti/crc
========================================

This directory holds the rustsmith Stage-1 mirror of
https://github.com/Nicoretti/crc (pure-Python CRC library).

* Upstream authors: Nicola Coretti <nico.coretti@gmail.com>,
  Gert van Dijk <github@gertvandijk.nl>
* Upstream license: BSD-2-Clause (full text: LICENSE-BSD-2-Clause where
  vendored; SPDX tag carried in every file header).
* This port: behavior-identical, same public API (`crc._crc` extension
  module plus `crc/__init__.py` + `crc/__main__.py` shims), published as
  the `crc-rust` distribution on PyPI (import name unchanged: `import crc`)
  with reusable core crate `crc-rust-core` on crates.io.

Provenance: every artifact preserves the upstream license header and this
attribution (provenance gate). See `release.toml` for the publishing
configuration and `docs/RELEASE.md` for the release procedure.
